%% SRCNN experiment overview / Baseline to C18
flowchart TB
  baseline["E000 / starting point<br/>Original float32, full maps<br/>522.28 M MAC / frame<br/>BRAM18K 11064; device has 288<br/>Function passes; storage cannot fit"]
  precision["E010-E019 / E062-E071<br/>Precision and independent references<br/>10-bit avg delta PSNR -0.0695 dB<br/>All 8-bit: about -5.18 dB<br/>Complete course set: 13 images; exact fixed reference"]
  compiler["E020-E029 / E032<br/>Compiler directives only<br/>Valid float control: about 3811 ms<br/>BRAM18K 11114<br/>Fixing invalid keys still leaves full-map storage"]
  streaming["E030-E033 / E047-E048<br/>Network streams and line buffers<br/>Remove intermediate maps: BRAM18K 168<br/>DSP binding and integer carriers<br/>Weight selectors remain large: LUT 89304"]
  scans["E034-E043 / E057-E067 scans<br/>LUTRAM banks, unrolling, and clock<br/>E043: HLS about 6.9392 ms<br/>DSP 505 / BRAM18K 168<br/>Within resource budget; HLS timing warning"]
  micro["E051-E055 / E071<br/>Multiplier and range controls<br/>DSP / fabric / constant-weight controls<br/>Primitive costs are not network results"]
  packing["A / P01-P16<br/>Packing: the cost of saving DSPs<br/>INT8 and exact10 primitives pass<br/>P10-P12 networks exceed LUT budget<br/>P13-P16 measured: direct mixed mapping beats INT16 packing"]
  scatter["C / E050 / E060 / G01-G03<br/>Conv3 scatter<br/>BRAM18K 168 -> 137 -> 87<br/>29.83 -> 37.70 -> 44.14 ms<br/>Less storage; more control and work"]
  memory["S01-S06<br/>DDR probe and fused tiles<br/>DDR scratch ports not exported<br/>B8-B64: less BRAM, halo recomputation<br/>DDR invalid; tiles miss LUT/time budgets"]
  winograd["D / W01-W18<br/>Winograd, continuous tiles, narrow banks<br/>W18: HLS about 4.2274 ms<br/>DSP 326 / LUT 74480<br/>Within resource budget; HLS timing warning"]
  continuous["B / F01-F15<br/>Continuous pipelines and fixed reads<br/>LUTRAM FIFOs, online padding<br/>Split windows, channel rotation, registered trees<br/>Avoid pixel restarts and reduce wide selectors"]
  combination["C01-C12 / combined experiments<br/>Winograd plus packing/mixed precision<br/>Lowest raw estimate C11: 1.0817 ms<br/>LUT 248797 / FF 307525<br/>Resource limits exclude it from candidate ranking"]
  loader["F16-F24<br/>Output conversion and loader timing<br/>F20: exact float encoding, zero DSPs<br/>F24: explicit 3D weight-loader indices<br/>Global critical path moves to loader counters"]
  f25["F25 / direct-convolution candidate<br/>Disable F24 weight-loader flattening<br/>HLS about 2.64226 ms / DSP 502<br/>BRAM18K 73 / LUT 69976<br/>2.5 ns still warns after clock uncertainty"]
  private["F26-F28 / private parameters<br/>Stream parameters into engine-owned banks<br/>F28: HLS 2.6151 ms / outside LUT 3170<br/>F26 area hypothesis fails; F27 misses loader-clock gate<br/>F28 passes WS2; F93/F94/F95 verify reload, images, routing"]
  t8["W19-W21 / F29-F30<br/>Winograd T8 with subkernel-indexed cache<br/>W19 misses LUT budget; W21 fits with 898 LUT spare<br/>Direct T8 controls still exceed budgets<br/>W21: HLS 525237 cycles; F97: RTL 558758 cycles"]
  verification["E069-E070 / F80-F98 / W20<br/>Numerical, RTL, and physical checks<br/>F93/F97: changed-parameter two-frame RTL Pass<br/>F92/F95/F98: independent 5 ns routing passes<br/>W20 remains diagnostic; no board acceptance"]
  w22["W22 / W21 integration fallback<br/>Same W21 RTL, routed at 4.95 ns<br/>F97 cycles at the closed target: 2.7658521 ms<br/>WNS +0.047 ns; retain F98 at 5 ns<br/>Later W32 closes 4.5 ns on identical RTL"]
  host["F32-F38 / host controls<br/>Correct measured memory registrations<br/>Unchanged F28/W21 designs; C checks and syntheses<br/>Later overlapping heavy jobs hit memory limits<br/>Current policy: one heavy plus budgeted light jobs"]
  rom["F35 / W24-W25 / W29-W31<br/>Fixed ROM removes parameter path<br/>Exact banks; 13 images and changed-input RTL pass<br/>RTL 554226 cycles; HLS 630 DSP / 53316 LUT<br/>W29 memory guard; W31 has no archived result"]
  clock["W23-W32 / F39-F43-F49-F52<br/>Route strategies and Conv3 operand registers<br/>W32 / F52 both close 4.5 ns<br/>558758 RTL cycles: 2.514411 ms/frame<br/>Route gates pass; earlier OOM/guard failures retained"]
  fifo["F40-F48 / F50-F51<br/>Buffer transformed windows at depth 16<br/>Feature FIFO16/32: no cycle benefit<br/>F48: 535771 cycles; saves 22987 vs F97<br/>30-cycle miss is diagnostic; user accepts T8 basis"]
  frp["W26-W30<br/>Free-running MAC fold pipelines<br/>W28: exact reload RTL, 549438 cycles<br/>W30 closes 4.5 ns: 2.472471 ms/frame<br/>Route gates pass; original W28 fail and later acceptance retained"]
  t4["C13-C15 / C18<br/>T4 prepack Conv2 during runtime loading<br/>C14: 300632 RTL cycles; C18 closes 5 ns<br/>1.503160 ms/frame / 1032 DSP / 58529 routed LUT<br/>E065 mixed precision; route gates pass, no board result"]
